        <RULE_TITLE>Woody Biomass Utilization</RULE_TITLE>
        <ABSTRACT><![CDATA[The Department of the Interior proposes to include an option for allowing service contractors the option to remove woody biomass generated as a result of land management service contracts wherever ecologically appropriate and in accordance with the law.  A new clause added to the Departments acquisition regulations would specify a contract clause to be used for this purpose.  No other changes in specifications are proposed.]]></ABSTRACT>
